{"id":"wb-1-173","name":"六顶山古墓群","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T12:17:39+00:00","status":"ready","title":"六顶山古墓群","text":"六顶山古墓群（韩语：륙정산옛무덤군）位于中国吉林省敦化市六顶山，渤海国古墓葬。\n\n六顶山古墓群的墓室均建于地下，分东西两个墓区，共有石室及封土墓80余座，墓葬多呈方形或长方形，以玄武岩和熔岩砌筑，一般长和宽各在2.5米至3.5米之间。墓室南壁设甬道，四壁用不规则的石块砌成，并涂抹白垩土。","shortened":true,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%85%AD%E9%A1%B6%E5%B1%B1%E5%8F%A4%E5%A2%93%E7%BE%A4","revisionId":90082250,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=90082250","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/696ead1ec630432cfd2ff104.jpg","title":"五号墓と奥に見える貞恵公主墓.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E4%BA%94%E5%8F%B7%E5%A2%93%E3%81%A8%E5%A5%A5%E3%81%AB%E8%A6%8B%E3%81%88%E3%82%8B%E8%B2%9E%E6%81%B5%E5%85%AC%E4%B8%BB%E5%A2%93.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/51/%E4%BA%94%E5%8F%B7%E5%A2%93%E3%81%A8%E5%A5%A5%E3%81%AB%E8%A6%8B%E3%81%88%E3%82%8B%E8%B2%9E%E6%81%B5%E5%85%AC%E4%B8%BB%E5%A2%93.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Senkaku Islands","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"五号墓と奥に見える貞恵公主墓","width":320,"height":240},"textScope":"body-excerpt"}